</div>
<div id="view-hire" class="hidden">
<div class="lead">Stand up a new AI operator in three steps: <b>pick the workflow</b>, <b>assign each task to an agent</b>, then <b>name it and set the cadence</b>. It joins the workforce.</div>
<div class="steps" id="bSteps"></div><div id="bBody"></div><div class="bnav" id="bNav"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="foot">Independent concept prototype prepared for a conversation with Wolfspeed. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or built on Wolfspeed systems or data. All operators and outputs are illustrative simulations; EV OEM accounts, 8-inch wafer yields, SiC MOSFET quotes, NRE fees, and AEC-Q101 qualification reports are placeholders. A human power engineer, fab yield manager, or sales director reviews and approves every quote, AEC-Q101 audit, fab yield release, ISO 26262 check, and SiC die mask ECO file.</div>
